  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigeria Public Finance Facility PFRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the Government of Nigeria in implementing major public financial management reforms by providing technial assistance, analysis, and capacity building focused on tax, fiscal, and debt management across the Ministry of Finance, Budget Office and other key stakeholder across the Nigerian government. A central strategic objective is to adaptively manage a prioritised, risk-informed portfolio of interventions that can respond dynamically to Nigeria&#x2019;s complex and evolving political and economic context. NPFF seeks to be a trusted, flexible partner that supports Nigeria&#x2019;s reform trajectory through informed, politically sensitive, and collaborative approaches, ultimately laying the foundation for accelerated, post-election reform progress.</narrative>
  </description>
